<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{with index .Data "kind"}}{{if eq . "signup_attempt"}}Someone tried to open a new Koro account with this e-mail address. No account was created because the address already has one.{{else if eq . "password_changed"}}The password of your Koro account was changed; your sessions on other devices were closed.{{else if eq . "email_change_requested"}}A change of the e-mail address of your Koro account was requested. It takes effect once confirmed through the link sent to the new address.{{else}}The e-mail address of your Koro account was changed.{{end}}{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;">If this was not you, <a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">reset your password now</a>.</p>
